			<item>
				<title>Neues Bauen in Hannover</title>
				<link>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/neues-bauen-in-hannover-1955/manifest.json</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 20:13:07 +0200</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/neues-bauen-in-hannover-1955/manifest.json</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Under the title &amp;ldquo;Neues Bauen in Hannover&amp;rdquo; there is already a book by &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;        &lt;a data-wikidata-entity=&#34;Q1730854&#34; href=&#34;https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karl_Elkart&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Karl Elkart&lt;/a&gt; (German), published in 1929. This can be viewed &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.digitales-stadtteilarchiv-linden-limmer.de/Document/buch-auszug-neues-bauen-in-hannover-1929/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;in excerpts&lt;/a&gt; (German) at the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.digitales-stadtteilarchiv-linden-limmer.de/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Digitales Stadtteilarchiv Linden-Limmer&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; (German).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here, however, this is the 1955 edition, which contains only interesting advertisements of relevance for this site.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
